# Allowlist mode: deny everything, then permit only files the Dockerfile
# COPYs. This is load-bearing safety — a future stray `COPY .sandcastle/.env`
# or `COPY . /app` then needs two simultaneous mistakes to leak a secret,
# not one. The orchestration loop verifies every COPY source has a matching
# `!<path>` entry here before kicking off a build.
*
!.sandcastle/Dockerfile
!node_modules/claude-code-kit/src/cc-rate-limit-shim
